{"parse":{"title":"Birch","revid":46658,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"border:2px solid var(--theme-accent-color); border-collapse:collapse; display: flex; flex-direction:row; font-size:95%; margin:auto; padding:0; width:70%; background-color:color-mix(in srgb, var(--theme-accent-color) 16%, transparent)\"><tbody><tr style=\"width: 100%;\"><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Hammer\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/81/Hammer.png/revision/latest?cb=20210208235106\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hammer.png\" data-image-key=\"Hammer.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></td><td><span style=\"font-size: 135%; font-weight: bold;\">This article is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Work_in_progress\" title=\"Category:Work in progress\">work in progress</a></span><br /><span>Information may be incomplete, poorly formatted or changed frequently. This is often content that is still in active development or unfinished.</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Birch</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6f/BirchTreesInFog.png/revision/latest?cb=20210205004609\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"BirchTreesInFog\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6f/BirchTreesInFog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210205004609\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6f/BirchTreesInFog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210205004609 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/6/6f/BirchTreesInFog.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210205004609 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"BirchTreesInFog\" width=\"270\" height=\"382\" data-image-key=\"BirchTreesInFog.png\" data-image-name=\"BirchTreesInFog.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"biome\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Biome</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Meadows\" title=\"Meadows\">Meadows</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Plains\" title=\"Plains\">Plains</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"wood_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Wood Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finewood\" title=\"Finewood\">Finewood</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"yield\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Yield</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"tool_needed\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tool Needed</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bronze_Axe\" title=\"Bronze Axe\">Bronze Axe</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"additional_loot\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Additional Loot</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Birch_seeds\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Birch seeds\">Birch seeds</a><br /><p><a href=\"/wiki/Feathers\" title=\"Feathers\">Feathers</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Resin\" title=\"Resin\">Resin</a><br /></p></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\nBirch is a type of tree that can be found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Meadows\" title=\"Meadows\">Meadows</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Plains\" title=\"Plains\">Plains</a> biomes. It is characterized by its white bark with black spots. A <a href=\"/wiki/Bronze_axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bronze axe\">Bronze axe</a> or better is required to damage it.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>Birch trees produce <a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Finewood\" title=\"Finewood\">Finewood</a> when destroyed. The yield of each type of wood is random, however, a birch tree will always drop 20 pieces of wood total (plus 2 Wood from its stump).\n</p><p>It is possible to damage Birch trees by intentionally hitting them with falling <a href=\"/wiki/Beech\" title=\"Beech\">Beech</a> trees. If enough damage is done by falling trees, the Birch tree will be brought down. The trunk can then be rolled downslope (ideally) and repeatedly smashed into obstacles until it shatters into usable lumber. Birch trees can also be destroyed by a <a href=\"/wiki/Troll\" title=\"Troll\">Troll</a>. These methods allow players to acquire <a href=\"/wiki/Finewood\" title=\"Finewood\">Finewood</a> before being able to craft a <a href=\"/wiki/Bronze_axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bronze axe\">Bronze axe</a>.\n</p><p>Birch trees come in 4 variations: two different shapes, each of which has two biome-dependent variations (which differ in color but not in shape). The two shapes can be distinguished by the number and position of their branches: Variation 1 has fewer large branches, the lowest of which is about 8 meters from the ground, while Variation 2 has a very thick branch which splits from the trunk at only about 4 meters from the ground, and more large branches up higher. Each of these shapes can come in two colors: with green leaves (in non-Plains <a href=\"/wiki/Biomes\" title=\"Biomes\">biomes</a>) or with yellow leaves (in Plains only). Each Birch tree's color is dependent entirely on which biome it spawns in, but its shape is determined entirely randomly. Player-grown Birch trees always have green foliage.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Drops\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Drops</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#From_stump\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">From stump</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#From_large_log\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">From large log</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#From_small_log\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">From small log</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Planting\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Planting</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drops\">Drops</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBirch%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Below, variants are abbreviated according to shape (1 or 2, as defined above) and by color (\"G\" for green or \"Y\" for yellow). For example, \"G1\" means \"green foliage, shape 1\".\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Amount\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Item\n</th>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Chance\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"4\" style=\"text-align:center\">Average per Tree\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>G1\n</th>\n<th>G2\n</th>\n<th>Y1\n</th>\n<th>Y2\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>Large Birch Logs\n</td>\n<td>100%\n</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>Birch Stump\n</td>\n<td>100%\n</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"7\">50% chance to drop between X and 2 of:\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-2\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resin\" title=\"Resin\"><img alt=\"Resin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/2/2c/Resin.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210215131821\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Resin.png\" data-image-key=\"Resin.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Resin\" title=\"Resin\">Resin</a>\n</td>\n<td>25%\n</td>\n<td>0.375</td>\n<td>0.1875</td>\n<td>0.1875</td>\n<td>0.1875\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-2\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Feathers\" title=\"Feathers\"><img alt=\"Feathers\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/a/a9/Feathers.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210215131551\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Feathers.png\" data-image-key=\"Feathers.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Feathers\" title=\"Feathers\">Feathers</a>\n</td>\n<td>25%\n</td>\n<td>0.375</td>\n<td>0.1875</td>\n<td>0.1875</td>\n<td>0.1875\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-2\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Birch_seeds\" title=\"Birch seeds\"><img alt=\"Birch Seeds\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Birch Seeds.png\" data-image-key=\"Birch_Seeds.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/d6/Birch_Seeds.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210926155201\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Birch_seeds\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Birch seeds\">Birch seeds</a>\n</td>\n<td>50%\n</td>\n<td>0.75</td>\n<td>0.375</td>\n<td>0.375</td>\n<td>0.375\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">...where X equals:\n</th>\n<td><b>2</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b></td>\n<td><b>1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"From_stump\">From stump</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBirch%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Amount\n</th>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\"><img alt=\"Wood\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/df/Wood.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210215132125\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>\n</td>\n<td>100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"From_large_log\">From large log</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBirch%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Amount\n</th>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>Small Birch Logs\n</td>\n<td>100%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"From_small_log\">From small log</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBirch%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Amount\n</th>\n<th>Item\n</th>\n<th>Chance\n</th>\n<th>Average per Tree\n</th>\n<th>Min–Max per Tree\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">10 of the following:\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\"><img alt=\"Wood\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Wood.png\" data-image-key=\"Wood.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/d/df/Wood.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210215132125\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Wood\" title=\"Wood\">Wood</a>\n</td>\n<td>50%\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>0–20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finewood\" title=\"Finewood\"><img alt=\"Finewood\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Finewood.png\" data-image-key=\"Finewood.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/9/98/Finewood.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210215131556\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Finewood\" title=\"Finewood\">Finewood</a>\n</td>\n<td>50%\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>0–20\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Planting\">Planting</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBirch%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Birch trees that grow naturally in the <a href=\"/wiki/Plains\" title=\"Plains\">Plains</a> biome have a different \"fall-like\", yellow color to its leaves compared to the variant of Birch found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Meadows\" title=\"Meadows\">Meadows</a>. However, should the player grow their own Birch trees in Plains by using the <a href=\"/wiki/Cultivator\" title=\"Cultivator\">Cultivator</a>, the player-cultivated trees will have green leaves like those found in Meadows. This makes the naturally grown Plains birch with the faded yellow hue finite and impossible to replace once chopped down.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<caption>Allowed Biomes:\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Meadows\n</th>\n<th>Yes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Black Forest\n</th>\n<th>Yes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Swamp\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mountain\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Plains\n</th>\n<th>Yes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mistlands\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ashlands\n</td>\n<td>No\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBirch%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Since the wood drops from the Birch tree's trunk are composed of multiple individual random rolls, each with the same chance and with two possible outcomes, the drop rate of Finewood per tree thus follows a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Binomial_distribution\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Binomial distribution\">Binomial distribution</a> with <i>n</i> = 20 and <i>p</i> = 0.5. For example, the chance of getting at least <i>k</i> Finewood from a tree (for integer <i>k</i> between 0 and 20) can be calculated with the formula <span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\" style=\"display: none;\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"{\\displaystyle \\sum _{i=0}^{k}{n \\choose i}p^{i}(1-p)^{n-i}}\">\n  <semantics>\n    <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n      <mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n        <munderover>\n          <mo>&#x2211;<!-- ∑ --></mo>\n          <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n            <mi>i</mi>\n            <mo>=</mo>\n            <mn>0</mn>\n          </mrow>\n          <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n            <mi>k</mi>\n          </mrow>\n        </munderover>\n        <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n          <mrow>\n            <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-OPEN\">\n              <mo maxsize=\"2.047em\" minsize=\"2.047em\">(</mo>\n            </mrow>\n            <mfrac linethickness=\"0\">\n              <mi>n</mi>\n              <mi>i</mi>\n            </mfrac>\n            <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-CLOSE\">\n              <mo maxsize=\"2.047em\" minsize=\"2.047em\">)</mo>\n            </mrow>\n          </mrow>\n        </mrow>\n        <msup>\n          <mi>p</mi>\n          <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n            <mi>i</mi>\n          </mrow>\n        </msup>\n        <mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n        <mn>1</mn>\n        <mo>&#x2212;<!-- − --></mo>\n        <mi>p</mi>\n        <msup>\n          <mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n          <mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n            <mi>n</mi>\n            <mo>&#x2212;<!-- − --></mo>\n            <mi>i</mi>\n          </mrow>\n        </msup>\n      </mstyle>\n    </mrow>\n    <annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle \\sum _{i=0}^{k}{n \\choose i}p^{i}(1-p)^{n-i}}</annotation>\n  </semantics>\n</math></span><img src=\"https://services.fandom.com/mathoid-facade/v1/media/math/render/svg/a1e777b098aa98d4c67109429319dbafd8692aa9\" class=\"mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"vertical-align: -3.005ex; max-width:20.573ex; max-height:7.343ex;\" alt=\"{\\displaystyle \\sum _{i=0}^{k}{n \\choose i}p^{i}(1-p)^{n-i}}\" /></span>.</li>\n<li>Birch wood can be harvested before getting a Tier 2 axe. If a Beech tree is felled and lands in the Birch's branches, splitting the tree will cause likely damage to the Birch sufficient to knock it down, creating a Birch log which may then be rolled into another Birch tree to cause it enough damage to fall, and the resulting Birch logs may be rolled into each other to cause damage until they break into Wood and Finewood. This requires a bit of luck, since Beech trees will fall in a random direction, though they can be guided slightly. (It also requires a great deal of patience).\n<ul><li>Trolls can also destroy Birch trees, especially the log-wielding ones, whose sweep attack can bring down several trees at once. Luring a Troll into a dense grove is a quite effective, though very dangerous, way to cut down a large number of trees.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Show\" data-collapsetext=\"Hide\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-title\"><th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\"><span class=\"navbox-vde\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:WorldNav\" title=\"Template:WorldNav\"><span title=\"View this navbox template\">v</span></a> · <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:WorldNav\"><span title=\"Discuss this navbox template\">d</span></a> · <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://valheim.fandom.com/wiki/Template:WorldNav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this navbox template\">e</span></a></span></span><div class=\"navbox-title-pad navbox-title-padleft navbox-title-padright\"><a href=\"/wiki/Valheim_(world)\" title=\"Valheim (world)\">World</a></div></th></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Biomes</th><td class=\"navbox-list\"><div class=\"hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Meadows\" title=\"Meadows\">Meadows</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Forest\" title=\"Black Forest\">Black Forest</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Ocean\" title=\"Ocean\">Ocean</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Swamp\" title=\"Swamp\">Swamp</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Mountain\" title=\"Mountain\">Mountain</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Plains\" title=\"Plains\">Plains</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Mistlands\" title=\"Mistlands\">Mistlands</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Ashlands\" title=\"Ashlands\">Ashlands</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Deep_North\" title=\"Deep North\">Deep North</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/World_Edge\" title=\"World Edge\">World Edge</a></div></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-gutter\"><td colspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr class=\"navbox-row alt\"><th class=\"navbox-group\" scope=\"row\">Points<br />of&#160;interest</th><td class=\"navbox-list\" style=\"background: none\"><div class=\"hlist\"></div><table class=\"navbox-subgroup\"><tbody><t